{"id":"person_chen_jiageng","type":"person","canonical_name":"陈嘉庚","traditional_name":"陳嘉庚","english_names":["Tan Kah Kee"],"aliases":[],"birth":{"raw":"1874年10月21日","normalized":"1874-10-21","place_id":"place_jimei","precision":"day"},"death":{"raw":"1961年8月12日","normalized":"1961-08-12","place_id":"place_beijing","precision":"day"},"ancestral_place_id":"place_jimei","residence_place_ids":["place_singapore","place_xiamen"],"occupations":["实业家","教育家","慈善家","华侨社群领袖"],"identity_tags":["福建华侨","南洋华商","教育事业","侨社领袖"],"short_summary":"福建集美人，1890年前往新加坡经商，后长期参与南洋华侨社群与教育公益事业。其在家乡持续兴学，1913年创办集美小学，1921年创办厦门大学，形成跨新加坡与闽南两地的重要华侨教育网络。","source_ids":["SRC-CJK-XMU-ADMISSIONS","SRC-CJK-XMU-JGXY","SRC-CJK-TKKF","SRC-CJK-NLB-IMG"],"event_ids":["event_cjk_birth","event_cjk_singapore_1890","event_cjk_jimei_school_1913","event_cjk_xmu_1921","event_cjk_hokkien_chair_1929"],"place_relation_ids":["rel_cjk_jimei","rel_cjk_singapore","rel_cjk_xiamen"],"organization_relation_ids":["rel_cjk_jimei_schools","rel_cjk_xmu","rel_cjk_hokkien"],"document_ids":[],"qiaopi_ids":[],"portrait_image_id":null,"portrait_publication_status":"external_reference_not_published_pending_rights","completion_level":"usable","review_status":"reviewed"}
{"id":"person_li_guangqian","type":"person","canonical_name":"李光前","traditional_name":"李光前","english_names":["Lee Kong Chian"],"aliases":[],"birth":{"raw":"1893年","normalized":"1893","place_id":"place_furong_nanan","precision":"year"},"death":{"raw":"1967年","normalized":"1967","place_id":"place_singapore","precision":"year"},"ancestral_place_id":"place_furong_nanan","residence_place_ids":["place_singapore"],"occupations":["实业家","银行家","慈善家"],"identity_tags":["福建南安","新加坡华商","慈善教育","银行业"],"short_summary":"福建南安芙蓉人，1903年随父赴新加坡。1916年进入陈嘉庚企业学习橡胶贸易，后成为重要工商与银行人物，1932年参与推动三家银行合并形成华侨银行，并于1952年创立李氏基金，长期资助教育和公共事业。","source_ids":["SRC-LKC-NLB-BIBLIO","SRC-LKC-NUS-BENEFACTOR","SRC-LKC-NLB-FELLOWSHIP","SRC-LKC-OCBC","SRC-LKC-NUS-LEEFOUNDATION","SRC-LKC-NLB-LIBRARY"],"event_ids":["event_lkc_birth","event_lkc_singapore_1903","event_lkc_tkk_1916","event_lkc_ocbc_1932","event_lkc_foundation_1952","event_lkc_library_1953"],"place_relation_ids":["rel_lkc_nanan","rel_lkc_singapore"],"organization_relation_ids":["rel_lkc_tkk_company","rel_lkc_ocbc","rel_lkc_lee_foundation"],"document_ids":[],"qiaopi_ids":[],"portrait_image_id":null,"portrait_publication_status":"external_reference_not_published_pending_rights","completion_level":"usable","review_status":"reviewed"}
{"id":"person_hu_wenhu","type":"person","canonical_name":"胡文虎","traditional_name":"胡文虎","english_names":["Aw Boon Haw"],"aliases":[],"birth":{"raw":"1882年","normalized":"1882","place_id":"place_yangon","precision":"year"},"death":{"raw":"1954年","normalized":"1954","place_id":null,"precision":"year"},"ancestral_place_id":"place_fujian_ancestral_aw","residence_place_ids":["place_yangon","place_singapore"],"occupations":["实业家","报业经营者","慈善家"],"identity_tags":["福建祖籍","东南亚华商","虎标万金油","报业"],"short_summary":"1882年生于仰光，家族祖籍福建。胡文虎与弟胡文豹经营并推广虎标万金油，1926年把事业重心迁至新加坡，并进一步扩展报业、银行与慈善活动。1937年为胡文豹建成虎豹别墅，成为其商业与文化记忆的重要地标。","source_ids":["SRC-AWH-NLB-GUIDE","SRC-AWH-NLB-BIBLIO","SRC-AWH-HAWPAR","SRC-AWH-NAS-VILLA"],"event_ids":["event_aw_birth","event_aw_tigerbalm_1909","event_aw_singapore_1926","event_aw_sinchew_1929","event_aw_villa_1937","event_aw_death_1954"],"place_relation_ids":["rel_aw_yangon","rel_aw_fujian","rel_aw_singapore"],"organization_relation_ids":["rel_aw_hawpar","rel_aw_sinchew"],"document_ids":[],"qiaopi_ids":[],"portrait_image_id":null,"portrait_publication_status":"external_reference_not_published_pending_rights","completion_level":"usable","review_status":"reviewed"}
